# Never commit your scans or photos: only the test fixtures, icons and screenshots are tracked
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.heic
*.pdf
*.zip
!tests/fixtures/*
!src/icons/*
!docs/screenshots/*.png
!mobile/android/app/src/main/res/**/*.png

